Science and course choices 

 All students will take the Science and Technology (SCT) course in 4th secondary 
 Successful completion of the SCT course in 4th secondary is MANDATORY to obtain the DES. 

 The student must choose from the following two possibilities: 

2 choices 
 Environmental Science and Technology (STE) 
 Entrepreneurship 

One art choice 

4 choices  Drama  Guitar 
 Visual Arts  Dance 

 Successful completion of the art course in 4th secondary is MANDATORY to obtain the DES. 

 The student must identify his or her choice and provide an alternative choice. 
 The management of educational services reserves the right to draw lots to ensure 
school organization. If applicable, the student will be notified.

