Science and course selection 

Science and technology (SCT) 
 Successful completion of the Science and technology course is MANDATORY to obtain the secondary school diploma (DES) 
 Modules on the Living Universe, the Material Universe, Earth and Space and the Technological Universe 

Environmental science and technology (STE) 
 Optional course that complements the Science and technology (SCT) course 
 Mandatory course to access 5th secondary chemistry and physics courses 
 JDLM requires a grade of 75% or more in 3rd secondary science to access the STE sequence 
 It is mandatory to take STE to continue in the enriched groups 

Entrepreneurship 

 Optional course 
 Course that will be assigned to all students who do not take STE
 Same optional course as for students in enriched groups 
 See description p. 10 

